        { mistake: "Missing the confession in “que cante quién fue”", whyItFails: "Nobody is asking for a song. The table wants the truth, and the verb makes the demand playful.", sayInstead: "Que diga quién fue, or que cante quién fue as a joke." },
        { mistake: "Saying “canto bueno” for “I sing well”", whyItFails: "Bueno describes a noun; bien describes how you do an action. Singing needs the adverb.", sayInstead: "Canto bien, or no canto muy bien." }
